/v1/","context":{"app_id":4900760,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4900760","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T10:12:28Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4913620","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4900760-1843481262693705","game_id":"steam-4900760","kind":"announcement","title":"The Official Stellar Harvest Gameplay Trailer Is Here!","summary":"Hi everyone!I'm excited to finally share the official gameplay trailer for Stellar Harvest!The new trailer showcases the journey through Stellar Harvest — starting on Earth and expanding across the Solar System as your energy empire grows.Build generators, unlock new worlds, harness Dark Energy, automate your production, watch civilization spread throughout the Solar System, and ultimately construct the Dyson Sphere you've been working toward.The free demo is available now on Steam, so if you ha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T00:04:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262693705","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4900760-1842212951304738","game_id":"steam-4900760","kind":"update","title":"Major Update v0.9.6 — The Solar System Comes Alive","summary":"Hi everyone!Today I'm excited to release Stellar Harvest's first major content update!This is the largest update to the game so far, introducing a new civilization visualization system, dynamic Random Events, a new soundtrack, expanded space activity, and a huge collection of visual improvements, fixes, and optimizations.Most importantly, your progression is now something you can see happening throughout the solar system.As your civilization grows, the once-empty solar system begins filling with","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T02:06:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951304738","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4900760-1840310314352670","game_id":"steam-4900760","kind":"update","title":"Patch Update v0.9.5 – Branding Refresh & UI Fixes","summary":"Hi everyone!A small update has just been pushed live for Stellar Harvest.ChangesUpdated branding across the game and Steam page to reflect the new Midnight Bay Interactive studio name.Fixed an encoding issue that could cause the Dark Energy compression dialog to display incorrect characters instead of the production boost arrow.Various polish and behind-the-scenes improvements.I'm also continuing work on the official trailer and marketing assets, so expect more updates as those come together.As ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T22:09:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314352670","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4900760-1839041357028014","game_id":"steam-4900760","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.9.4 Community Feedback & Stability Update","summary":"Update v0.9.4Thank you to everyone who has been playing the Stellar Harvest demo and sharing your feedback. This update introduces a new way to communicate directly with the development of the game, along with additional stability improvements and bug fixes.NewAdded a Community Feedback button to the main menu.Submit:Bug ReportsSuggestionsBalance FeedbackUI / UX FeedbackPerformance IssuesGeneral FeedbackDemo players can quickly wishlist the full game after submitting feedback.ImprovementsAdditio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T23:07:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357028014","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4900760-1838407329255221","game_id":"steam-4900760","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.9.3 Graphics, Settings & Quality of Life Update","summary":"Hello everyone!I've been spending the past few days improving many of the systems behind Stellar Harvest, with a focus on giving players more control over their experience while continuing to polish the game.This update introduces a significant expansion of the graphics and settings systems, along with numerous quality-of-life improvements throughout the game.Expanded Graphics SettingsThe graphics settings have been significantly expanded, allowing you to customize the experience to better match","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-15T22:09:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329255221","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4900760-1836506165578729","game_id":"steam-4900760","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix v0.9.2 – Performance & Stability Improvements","summary":"ChangesPerformanceOptimized temporary visual effect cleanup.Reduced unnecessary event listener overhead.Improved lifecycle management for temporary particle effects and floating text.Optimized canvas rendering by caching the background rendering context.Reduced unnecessary DOM operations during gameplay.StabilityImproved cleanup of temporary animation effects.Added additional safeguards to prevent resource accumulation during extended play sessions.Improved internal performance monitoring and di","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T18:20:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165578729","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4900760-1836506165577058","game_id":"steam-4900760","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix v0.9.1– Demo Rendering Compatibility Update","summary":"A small hotfix has just been uploaded to the demo.ChangesAdjusted the Steam Overlay rendering behavior to improve compatibility with certain hardware configurations.This change is intended to address a report of severe screen flickering experienced by one player.I haven't been able to reproduce the issue on my own systems, but I'd rather get a potential fix out quickly than wait for additional reports.If you were experiencing screen flickering, please update to the latest version and let me know","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T02:22:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165577058","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4900760-1836506165576592","game_id":"steam-4900760","kind":"announcement","title":"The Stellar Harvest Demo is Now Live! 🚀","summary":"Begin your journey on Earth and build a planetary energy empire from the ground up. Harvest energy, unlock increasingly powerful generators and upgrades, and experience the Dark Energy prestige system as you expand across the solar system.In the demo you'll experience:🌍 Build and automate energy production on Earth⚡ Unlock generators and powerful upgrades🌑 Prestige for Dark Energy and permanent progression🪐 Take your first steps toward conquering the solar systemThe full game expands far beyond ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T19:27:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165576592","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4900760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:09:50Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:09:49Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4900760":"2026-10-26T05:09:50Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4900760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:09:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:09:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4913620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:09:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:09:50Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4900760","app_id":4900760,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:05Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"40c6d046f9f7ccb213b6fa1e7bb9e2b0fd914341f8626fa2239bc871c6f4e056","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Harvest energy across the solar system. Build generators on alien worlds, prestige for Dark Energy, and construct a Dyson Sphere around the Sun. Ten planets. Infinite power. One way home.","publishers":[{"name":"Midnight Bay Interactive","creator_clan_account_id":46224720}],"developers":[{"name":"Midnight Bay Interactive","creator_clan_account_id":46224720}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Stellar Harvest Official Gameplay Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1789057591","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4900760/365017308/c520d18f53165682297ea4d1041a150ad575c5f6/1789057122/micro